Derived from upstream commit 327d9d5 ("Change license from GPL to Apache 2").

Changes made in this derivative work:
  * Removed the interactive table editor (navigation, row/column insert,
    delete and move, split/join, CSV conversion, per-view toggles) and all
    table syntaxes other than GitHub Flavored Markdown pipe tables.
  * Replaced the table model and parser with a single pure-Python formatter
    (markdown_table.py) and one Sublime Text command
    (markdown_table_format.py).
  * Replaced the hand-written wide-character ranges with unicodedata.
  * Ported to Sublime Text 4 / Python 3.8 and removed Python 2 code.
